All operations are performed in the workspace organization.

Always use the workspace organization.
project/
|- src/                 # all source code, resource files, and tests.
|- bin/                 # support scripts to run and test the project.
|- docs/                # project documentation and design. All documentation is written in Markdown, all graphics are in Mermaid format. All documentation is in British English.
|- pom.xml              # build configuration.

NEVER delete code without approval, mark redundant code as deprecated, comment out code that is not used anymore and mark it with a TODO tag.
